{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26246","headline":"送刘禹锡侍御出刺连州 · 殷尧藩","name":"送刘禹锡侍御出刺连州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遐荒迢遰五羊城，归兴浓消客里情。\n家近似忘山路险，土甘殊觉瘴烟轻。\n梅花清入罗浮梦，荔子红分广海程。\n此去定知偿隐趣，石田春雨读书耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}